{"sha":"f766f51583c23acc33b2a7824654ef2029a96804","node_id":"C_kwDOGUAR-9oAKGY3NjZmNTE1ODNjMjNhY2MzM2IyYTc4MjQ2NTRlZjIwMjlhOTY4MDQ","commit":{"author":{"name":"VladyslavBudiukWOOF","email":"vlad.b@woof.software","date":"2026-06-23T21:24:14Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-06-23T21:24:14Z"},"message":"Feat/develop regular update (#1135)\n\nNo live-market changes - interface relocation, tests, **dev** config\nonly.\n\n- Interfaces moved to contracts/interfaces/, all imports re-pointed\n(woof [455](https://github.com/woof-software/comet/pull/455))\n- Scenarios (woof\n[454](https://github.com/woof-software/comet/pull/454)): --glob flag,\nsetEtherBalance gas funding, Configurator + allowBySig + allow coverage;\nremoved dead MaticX/V2 scenarios\n- Unit test: expanded allow/approve (woof\n[457](https://github.com/woof-software/comet/pull/457))\n- Dev config: marketAdminPermissionChecker in dev deploy, MockERC20\nallowlisted\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Mikhailo Shabodyash <misha.sh@woof.software>\nCo-authored-by: vladyslavBudiuk <vladyslav.b@woof.software>\nCo-authored-by: vlad-woof-software <sundunchan@woof.software>\nCo-authored-by: anik-woof <anna.shr@woof.software>","tree":{"sha":"1101bf195fce18dc1feb3e56c992adfddac27b0e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/compound-finance/comet/git/trees/1101bf195fce18dc1feb3e56c992adfddac27b0e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/compound-finance/comet/git/commits/f766f51583c23acc33b2a7824654ef2029a96804","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqOvl+CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAATjwQAFQ8V7BQb/HwWmupBjsbMZMg\nSgRe9GAU4eStXetH4yWLffJmABGMteYb1rFIpgmgK8kkE0RR+1QDbQKGl6BSD/Bo\nVvVVjUBcvFNQzn/NIlB1gzMPJvy27WTf6qYXijq1rjfrq6zsO87L7fjqeiP1n0HT\n1nphJMUmVp/vH9oysBqnQuJPKlcbyIBCf0O+Cbjl2y5FjNIyHQ+5KyHJBW3pzYU/\nU+ok3YANBGsZOHgqZPW8BeLiyVK8J/E2c2J5eiMsPbco4NV9JainNLcIqinbD5YV\nCszplKQlpI4JIKT/XeVoLe7uhovE9GCHqILLsJFaad1QM8nbBZSfi/EKIRkKm5i3\nccmzRkrjNx4KezJMNHKDrdD7mt/2/uNaA7d7G2DmNdmQGmE6dOVpuZ1F2Rdk38SN\nH8bS3LBZ7UM7MNwGLFqqDUeUb8UZ9dkaY029Kss8mJRTKYN1KmVtGTTa9vNYUi81\n6twBt5zgH49PPv3JIWFb/dGIcrEPiFNWXR7+lRsNHFjxzgKVEs99D4Z/HzaLPNci\nJ8HIJviuxqoi/AC+hW4p1CZPsVjfb6e2z34bens5kXvMIExBEItwr+HZOJ1ItRAi\ncuy2hxfprTj0VZ2ASrY5SzAGZXUEteLIcP32fbB7kfjmeFLjTnfd+G0822Qx4Ibb\nSHaVffmXzN1QzhmsW9DP\n=GldA\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 1101bf195fce18dc1feb3e56c992adfddac27b0e\nparent db72b0ca39118098846605479d156ce9b1736cf3\nauthor VladyslavBudiukWOOF <vlad.b@woof.software> 1782249854 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782249854 -0700\n\nFeat/develop regular update (#1135)\n\nNo live-market changes - interface relocation, tests, **dev** config\nonly.\n\n- Interfaces moved to contracts/interfaces/, all imports re-pointed\n(woof [455](https://github.com/woof-software/comet/pull/455))\n- Scenarios (woof\n[454](https://github.com/woof-software/comet/pull/454)): --glob flag,\nsetEtherBalance gas funding, Configurator + allowBySig + allow coverage;\nremoved dead MaticX/V2 scenarios\n- Unit test: expanded allow/approve (woof\n[457](https://github.com/woof-software/comet/pull/457))\n- Dev config: marketAdminPermissionChecker in dev deploy, MockERC20\nallowlisted\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Mikhailo Shabodyash <misha.sh@woof.software>\nCo-authored-by: vladyslavBudiuk <vladyslav.b@woof.software>\nCo-authored-by: vlad-woof-software <sundunchan@woof.software>\nCo-authored-by: anik-woof <anna.shr@woof.software>","verified_at":"2026-06-23T21:24:14Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/compound-finance/comet/commits/f766f51583c23acc33b2a7824654ef2029a96804","html_url":"https://github.com/compound-finance/comet/commit/f766f51583c23acc33b2a7824654ef2029a96804","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/compound-finance/comet/commits/f766f51583c23acc33b2a7824654ef2029a96804/comments","author":{"login":"VladyslavBudiukWOOF","id":191156033,"node_id":"U_kgDOC2TPQQ","avatar_url":"https